New for this game: the rules of both machines, the reel symbols and the
"SLOTS" title lettering (tools/assets.py, tools/art/), the sound effects and
the presentation. The input, palette, effects, saving, sound and debug code
comes from CHBlackjack, CHChess and CHCraps by the same author.
